1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,853
Hi, George!

2
00:00:01,853 --> 00:00:05,800
Glad you're back, Loads of people have phoned you.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:05,850
Really?

4
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:08,580
— I felt just like your secretary!

5
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:08,882
Sorry!

6
00:00:08,882 --> 00:00:13,114
I went into the library this afternoon to have a look at a newspaper

7
00:00:13,114 --> 00:00:15,230
and I came across something really interesting.

8
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:15,595
What?

9
00:00:15,595 --> 00:00:16,325
A book?

10
00:00:16,325 --> 00:00:19,975
— No, a brochure from a summer festival - mainly Spanish music.

11
00:00:19,975 --> 00:00:21,800
Look, I've got it here.

12
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,886
Spanish music?

13
00:00:22,886 --> 00:00:25,600
I really love the guitar.

14
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,191
Let's have a look.

15
00:00:28,191 --> 00:00:31,430
So what's this group 'Guitarrini'?

16
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:32,303
They're really good.

17
00:00:32,303 --> 00:00:36,379
They had a video with all the highlights of the festival at a stand

18
00:00:36,379 --> 00:00:38,126
in the lobby to the library,

19
00:00:38,126 --> 00:00:39,290
so I heard them.

20
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:44,600
They play fantastic instruments - drums and flutes and old kinds of guitars.

21
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:47,766
I've never heard anything like it before.

22
00:00:47,766 --> 00:00:48,670
— Sounds great.

23
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:49,192
Okay.

24
00:00:49,192 --> 00:00:51,281
Shall we go then?

25
00:00:51,281 --> 00:00:52,326
Spoil ourselves?

26
00:00:52,326 --> 00:00:53,370
— Yes, let's.

27
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:57,960
The only problem is there aren't any cheap seats.., it's all one price.

28
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:02,816
Well, in that case we could sit right at the front - we'd have

29
00:01:02,816 --> 00:01:04,310
a really good view.

30
00:01:04,310 --> 00:01:04,571
Yeah.

31
00:01:04,571 --> 00:01:08,218
though I think that if you sit at the back you can actually hear

32
00:01:08,218 --> 00:01:09,260
the whole thing better.

33
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:09,817
Yes.

34
00:01:09,817 --> 00:01:14,270
Anyway we can decide when we get there.

35
00:01:14,270 --> 00:01:18,040
So will you fill in the form or shall I?

36
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:20,437
I'll do it.

37
00:01:20,437 --> 00:01:21,236
Name:

38
00:01:21,236 --> 00:01:22,835
Georcle O'Neill.

39
00:01:22,835 --> 00:01:23,634
Address:

40
00:01:23,634 --> 00:01:26,830
48 North Avenue, Westsea.

41
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:29,074
Do you remember our new postcode?

42
00:01:29,074 --> 00:01:30,570
Still can't remember it.

43
00:01:30,570 --> 00:01:36,304
Just a minute - I've got it written down here.

44
00:01:36,304 --> 00:01:37,578
WS6 2YH.

45
00:01:37,578 --> 00:01:41,400
Do you need the phone too?

46
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:41,872
Please.

47
00:01:41,872 --> 00:01:44,230
I'm really bad at numbers.

48
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:46,674
01674 553242.

49
00:01:46,674 --> 00:01:55,230
So, let's book two tickets for Guitarrini.

50
00:01:55,230 --> 00:01:55,515
Okay.

51
00:01:55,515 --> 00:01:58,083
If you're sure ￡7.50 each is all right.

52
00:01:58,083 --> 00:02:00,080
How do you feel about the singer?

53
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,642
I haven't quite decided.

54
00:02:01,642 --> 00:02:06,720
But I've noticed something on the booking form that might just persuade me!

55
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,350
What's that then?

56
00:02:08,350 --> 00:02:09,437
— Free refreshments!

57
00:02:09,437 --> 00:02:09,980
— Really?

58
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:11,527
Yes, look here.

59
00:02:11,527 --> 00:02:13,589
Sunday 17th of June.

60
00:02:13,589 --> 00:02:18,230
Singer, ticket ￡6.00 includes drinks in the garden.

61
00:02:18,230 --> 00:02:19,880
Sounds like a bargain to me!

62
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:22,910
Yes, let's book two tickets for that.

63
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:24,421
So, what else?

64
00:02:24,421 --> 00:02:26,940
I'm feeling quite keen now!

65
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:29,800
How about the pianist on the 22nd of June?

66
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,680
Anna Ventura?

67
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:34,200
I've just remembered that's my evening class night.

68
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:34,783
That's okay.

69
00:02:34,783 --> 00:02:39,450
I'll just have to go on my own - but we can go to the Spanish dance

70
00:02:39,450 --> 00:02:41,200
and guitar concert together, can't we?

71
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:44,612
Yes - I'm sure Tom and Kieran would enjoy that too.

72
00:02:44,612 --> 00:02:46,660
Good heavens - ￡10.50 a ticket!

73
00:02:46,660 --> 00:02:50,593
I can see we're going to have to go without food for the rest

74
00:02:50,593 --> 00:02:52,840
of the week - we'll need to book four!

75
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,502
Wish we were students - look!

76
00:02:55,502 --> 00:03:01,360
Children, Students and Senior Citizens get a 50% discount on everything.

77
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,510
If only!
